      "change": "Deliberate pre-release update of the 1.0 lock for additive optional fields only: MarkSpec.extent (\"bounded\" | \"line\") in activity templates and ActivityArtifact.assistance (assistance receipt references) in artifacts and save-artifact requests. Every record valid before the update stays valid; no field became required.",
